      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMa8Xx4 Embedded Cortex®-A35 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX8X with high computing power combined with high-speed interfaces.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa8Xx4 Embedded Module is a high-performance solution for embedded computing engineers. Based on the ARM Cortex-A35 core technology, this module offers impressive computing power along with high-speed interfaces. It provides graphics support with 4K capabilities and features integrated security functions. With an included Cortex M4 CPU for real-time and security needs, low power consumption, and support for audio processing DSP, it's a versatile choice for various applications. Additionally, it offers multiple CAN FD interfaces and extensive connectivity options.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:07:26 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
