     "table_container_copy_558282354": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:161px;\"><b>TQMa8XD4-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>i.MX8X Dual/typ 1.0 GHz/max 1.2 GHz, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 1 GB LPDDR4, 64 kB EEPROM, -25°C…+85°C</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:161px;\"><b>TQMa8XDP4-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>i.MX8X Dual Plus/typ 1.0 GHz/max 1.2 GHz, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 2 GB LPDDR4, 64 kB EEPROM, -25°C…+85°</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:161px;\"><b>TQMa8XQP4-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>i.MX8X Quad Plus/typ 1.0 GHz/max 1.2 GHz, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 2 GB LPDDR4, 64 kB EEPROM, -25°C…+85°</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:161px;\"><b>STKa8Xx4-AA</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>STKa8Xx4 (Eval Kit) with TQMa8Xx4-AA, i.MX8X/typ 1.0 GHz/max 1.2 GHz, 2(1) GB LPDDR4, 8 GB eMMC Flash, 64 kB EEPROM, 1x RS232, 2x CAN FD separated, 1x USB 3.0 OTG, 4x USB 2.0 HOST, 2x ETH 10/100/1000, 1x HDMI/DP, 2x LVDS/DSI, 1x PCIe, RTC, Temperature sensor, Reset-Button, SD interface, Power Supply, 4 GB SD card, Cables</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td style=\"width:161px;\"><b>Starterkit STK8Xx4 set</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>The core of the STKa8Xx4 set is the TQMa8Xx4 module with a i.MX8X Cortex A35 CPU. The components contained in the starter kit constitute a modular system enabling you to develop your own product ideas. Development of graphic interfaces can be started immediately using a TQ display kit which is adjusted for a starter kit. To develop your own hardware you can use the certified and qualified circuit components of the starter kit in your own designs.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:07:47 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
      "textIsRich": "true",
